WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.776
Today we will present performance work as a team. Our work connects with

00:00:04.776 --> 00:00:07.240
international artists and communities around the world.

00:00:08.117 --> 00:00:11.231
Agree on the order of songs, dance or drama items.

00:00:12.117 --> 00:00:15.125
Rehearse entry, performance and respectful exit.

00:00:16.117 --> 00:00:21.388
Present the item and thank the audience at the end. Justify a revision using evidence

00:00:21.388 --> 00:00:22.794
from another world tradition.
